[{"target":"ielts-progressive-anchor-0","html":"<aside class=\"sidebar\" id=\"workspace-navigation\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#study\"><span class=\"brand-mark\">i.</span><span class=\"brand-type\">IELTS<span>我的备考工作区</span></span></a><nav aria-label=\"主导航\"><button data-go=\"study\" type=\"button\"><span>学习</span></button><button data-go=\"vocabulary-review\" type=\"button\"><span>单词</span></button><button data-go=\"word-review\" type=\"button\"><span>复习</span></button><button data-go=\"sentence-learning\" type=\"button\"><span>句子</span></button><button data-go=\"practice\" type=\"button\"><span>练习</span></button><button data-go=\"tests\" type=\"button\"><span>测试</span></button><button data-go=\"writing-workbench\" type=\"button\"><span>写作工作台</span></button><button data-go=\"workspace\" type=\"button\"><span>工作台</span></button></nav><div class=\"sidebar-goal\"><p>按自己的节奏学习。</p></div><div class=\"sidebar-foot\"><span class=\"status-dot\"></span><span>本地学习 · 第一册</span></div></aside><header class=\"workspace-topbar ui-only\"><button aria-controls=\"workspace-navigation\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-label=\"打开导航\" class=\"mobile-menu\" id=\"mobile-menu\">☰</button><div class=\"breadcrumb\"><span>我的工作区</span><i>/</i><strong id=\"current-page-label\">学习首页</strong></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><span class=\"save-indicator\"><i></i><span id=\"save-status\" role=\"status\">文字保存在当前浏览器</span><button id=\"lookup-open\" title=\"点击英文词直接查词；图片中的词可手动输入\" type=\"button\">查词</button></span><a class=\"records-link\" hidden=\"\" href=\"#records\">我的记录 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M4 12h15m-6-6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></header><button aria-label=\"关闭导航\" class=\"nav-scrim ui-only\" hidden=\"\"></button><main><!--ielts-progressive-anchor-1--></main><aside aria-labelledby=\"lookup-heading\" aria-modal=\"false\" hidden=\"\" id=\"word-lookup\" role=\"dialog\">\r\n<div class=\"lookup-top\"><h2 id=\"lookup-heading\">生词注释</h2><button aria-label=\"关闭生词注释\" id=\"lookup-close\" type=\"button\">×</button></div>\r\n<form id=\"lookup-form\"><input aria-label=\"要查询的英文词或词组\" id=\"lookup-input\" maxlength=\"80\" placeholder=\"输入英文词或短词组\"/><button type=\"submit\">查询</button></form>\r\n<div aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"lookup-result\"><p>点击正文英文词即可查看注释；也可以在上面输入。</p></div>\r\n<p class=\"lookup-muted\">查询自动留在历史中；点击收藏可加入单词表。收藏与原句保存在当前浏览器，首次查词需要联网加载词库。</p><a class=\"lookup-dictionary\" href=\"#records\">打开查词与复习记录 →</a></aside><!--LEARNING-UPGRADE:sentence-popup--><div aria-label=\"选中文字的操作\" class=\"st-toolbar\" hidden=\"\" id=\"selection-toolbar\" role=\"toolbar\">\r\n<span id=\"selection-preview\"></span><div class=\"st-actions\"><button id=\"selection-lookup\" type=\"button\">查词</button><button id=\"selection-collect\" type=\"button\">☆ 收藏单词</button><button id=\"selection-translate\" type=\"button\">翻译句子 · 联网</button><button aria-label=\"收起选择工具\" id=\"selection-dismiss\" type=\"button\">×</button></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<aside aria-labelledby=\"sentence-heading\" aria-modal=\"false\" class=\"st-popup\" hidden=\"\" id=\"sentence-popup\" role=\"dialog\">\r\n<div class=\"st-heading\"><h2 id=\"sentence-heading\">句子翻译</h2><button aria-label=\"关闭句子翻译\" id=\"sentence-close\" type=\"button\">×</button></div>\r\n<label>原句<textarea id=\"sentence-source\" maxlength=\"3000\" placeholder=\"选中正文中的句子，或在这里输入。\" rows=\"4\"></textarea></label>\r\n<div class=\"st-actions\"><label>方向<select id=\"sentence-direction\"><option value=\"en|zh-CN\">英文 → 中文</option><option value=\"zh-CN|en\">中文 → 英文</option></select></label><button id=\"sentence-translate\" type=\"button\">联网翻译</button></div>\r\n<p class=\"st-muted\">MyMemory 在线翻译，只发送上方原句。每次最多 500 字节（约 80 个英文词）；译文供理解参考，可自行修订。</p>\r\n<p aria-live=\"polite\" id=\"sentence-status\" role=\"status\"></p>\r\n<label>译文<textarea id=\"sentence-result\" maxlength=\"6000\" placeholder=\"译文会显示在这里，也可以输入自己的翻译。\" rows=\"4\"></textarea></label>\r\n<div class=\"st-actions\"><button id=\"sentence-save\" type=\"button\">☆ 收藏句子</button><a href=\"#sentence-learning\" id=\"sentence-notebook-link\">打开句子本 →</a></div>\r\n<div class=\"st-external\"><a id=\"sentence-bing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">在必应翻译中打开 ↗</a></div>\r\n</aside>\r\n<!--/LEARNING-UPGRADE:sentence-popup--><div class=\"toast\" hidden=\"\" id=\"toast\" role=\"status\"></div><!--ielts-progressive-script-0-->\r\n<!--ielts-progressive-script-1--><!--ielts-progressive-script-2--><!--ielts-progressive-script-3--><!--ielts-progressive-script-4--><!--ielts-progressive-script-5-->"}]